  "details": "I own a PC with a RTX 5080 and a amd ryzen 7 9800x3d and 32GB of ram. My temps are usually around 50°C (rarely 60) in both my CPU and GPU but for the past 2 weeks my CPU been reaching 70°C every time a video stops playing in many worlds. The fans fire up like crazy and that is worrying me. Whenever a video starts the temperatures go back down by 20°C. \n\nDoes anyone got this bug as well? I wanna listen to music and chill with friends but my mind keeps going back to this.",
